<Base title="About — Muhammad Irfan Waseem" description="Meet Muhammad Irfan Waseem, a Computer Science student building Flutter applications for ordering, inventory and business workflows."><section class="wrap page-body about-office"><img class="about-office-portrait" src={url('images/irfan-about.webp')} alt="Muhammad Irfan Waseem seated in an office chair wearing a charcoal blazer, black shirt and silver wristwatch" width="1086" height="1448" decoding="async" /><div class="prose"><h1>Beyond the Code — The Developer Behind the Work</h1>
      <p>I'm Muhammad Irfan Waseem, a passionate Software Developer and Computer Science student at COMSATS University Islamabad, Sahiwal Campus, with a strong interest in mobile application development, full-stack technologies, intelligent systems, and creative digital experiences.</p>
      <p>I specialize in developing practical, scalable, and user-focused software solutions using Flutter, Dart, Firebase, and modern web technologies. My work extends beyond writing code — I focus on understanding real-world challenges, designing efficient system architectures, and transforming ideas into meaningful digital products.</p>
      <p>Through projects such as Food Fight and MillX ERP, I explore how technology can simplify complex business operations, improve user experiences, and connect people with intelligent software systems.</p>
      <p>I believe great software is built at the intersection of creativity, engineering, and purpose. I continuously explore emerging technologies, refine my development skills, and challenge myself to build solutions that are both technically sound and visually engaging.</p>
      <p>My goal is to grow as a versatile software engineer, contribute to innovative projects, and create digital experiences that deliver meaningful real-world value.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={url('projects/')}>Explore my work</a><a class="button quiet" href={url('experience/')}>Experience & education</a></div></div></section></Base>

